ol.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/meritage-homes-corp-mth-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[4,4,0,5.21],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.1817,"r5":0.1548,"r20":0.1925,"r1_spy":0.1864,"r5_spy":0.1681,"r20_spy":0.2223}}],"quotes":[{"c":"MTH 2018 Q3","e":"mth","d":"2018-10-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steven Hilton","x":"Combining the increased closes with the price increases we took earlier in the year, we were able to hold our home closing gross margin and overhead leverage steady despite significant cost headwinds, which Hilla will discuss in more detail later.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/26/meritage-homes-corp-mth-q3-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"MTH 2018 Q4","e":"mth","d":"2019-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steven Hilton","x":"We expanded our gross margin by 60 bps over 2017 despite continued cost pressures and the lack of pricing power in the last half of the year as we are beginning to realize more operating efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/meritage-homes-mth-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"MTH 2018 Q4","e":"mth","d":"2019-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Hilla Sferruzza","x":"…able to offset the negative impact of a higher lumber cost that flows through our fourth-quarter closings through a combination of cost reductions in other areas, home price increases taken earlier in 2018 and the favorable mix shift toward entry-level, which has a higher average profit margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/meritage-homes-mth-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"MTH 2018 Q4","e":"mth","d":"2019-01-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Hilton","x":"We're also beginning to capture efficiencies in the back-office as a result of simplifying and streamlining, which will help us reduce overhead costs and improve our SG&A leverage in the future after incurring start-up costs in 2018 related to the strategic conversion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/meritage-homes-mth-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"MTH 2018 Q4","e":"mth","d":"2019-01-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Phillippe Lord","x":"I'll now -- turning to Slide 11, direct cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/meritage-homes-mth-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"MTH 2019 Q1","e":"mth","d":"2019-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven J. Hilton","x":"Along those lines, one of our latest developments is to simplify and streamline the process -- the process, that is our partnership with loan depot, who is offering a fully automated, secured digital pre-approval process, exclusively for Meritage Homes and available on our website.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/meritage-homes-corp-mth-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MTH 2019 Q1","e":"mth","d":"2019-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hilla Sferruzza","x":"Compared to the first quarter of 2018, our 2019 SG&A expenses included higher brokerage commissions, severance costs of approximately $1.1 million and another $1.4 million for accelerated equity compensation pulled forward into Q1 from future period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/meritage-homes-corp-mth-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MTH 2019 Q2","e":"mth","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Phillippe Lord","x":"As we continue to roll out our strategy, we are streamlining our products and processes to enable us to start more homes, convert those sales into closings more quickly and reduce our costs in the process to drive greater profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/meritage-homes-corp-mth-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"MTH 2019 Q2","e":"mth","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hilla Sferruzza","x":"We also incurred severance costs of approximately $1.7 million and another $1.4 million for accelerated equity compensation this year that was pulled forward into Q1 from future period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/meritage-homes-corp-mth-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,8525,0,0,0,6496,1509],[36,1,11354,0,0,0,8537,2277],[37,1,11406,0,0,0,8853,1948],[38,1,7891,0,0,0,6237,1263]],"cinema":[[35,1,8525,0,0,0,6496,1509],[36,1,11354,0,0,0,8537,2277],[37,1,11406,0,0,0,8853,1948],[38,1,7891,0,0,0,6237,1263]],"imax":[[35,1,8525,0,0,0,6496,1509],[36,1,11354,0,0,0,8537,2277],[37,1,11406,0,0,0,8853,1948],[38,1,7891,0,0,0,6237,1263]],"streaming":[[35,1,8525,0,0,0,6496,1509],[36,1,11354,0,0,0,8537,2277],[37,1,11406,0,0,0,8853,1948],[38,1,7891,0,0,0,6237,1263]],"dtc":[[35,1,8525,0,0,0,6496,1509],[36,1,11354,0,0,0,8537,2277],[37,1,11406,0,0,0,8853,1948],[38,1,7891,0,0,0,6237,1263]],"ai_spend":[[35,1,8525,0,0,0,6496,1509],[36,1,11354,0,0,0,8537,2277],[37,1,11406,0,0,0,8853,1948],[38,1,7891,0,0,0,6237,1263]],"tariffs":[[35,1,8525,0,0,0,6496,1509],[36,1,11354,0,0,0,8537,2277],[37,1,11406,0,0,0,8853,1948],[38,1,7891,0,0,0,6237,1263]],"pricing_power":[[35,1,8525,1,1,0,6496,1509],[36,1,11354,9,8,1,8537,2277],[37,1,11406,0,0,0,8853,1948],[38,1,7891,0,0,0,6237,1263]],"cost_cuts":[[35,1,8525,0,0,0,6496,1509],[36,1,11354,7,6,1,8537,2277],[37,1,11406,5,5,0,8853,1948],[38,1,7891,4,4,0,6237,1263]],"guidance":[[35,1,8525,0,0,0,6496,1509],[36,1,11354,0,0,0,8537,2277],[37,1,11406,0,0,0,8853,1948],[38,1,7891,0,0,0,6237,1263]],"ai_disruption":[[35,1,8525,0,0,0,6496,1509],[36,1,11354,0,0,0,8537,2277],[37,1,11406,0,0,0,8853,1948],[38,1,7891,0,0,0,